            "id": "https://xubiaolin.github.io/2025/07/19/huan-jing-wen-ti/a-li-yun-yu-ming-zhuan-yi-dao-cloudflare/",
            "url": "https://xubiaolin.github.io/2025/07/19/huan-jing-wen-ti/a-li-yun-yu-ming-zhuan-yi-dao-cloudflare/",
            "title": "阿里云域名转移到Cloudflare",
            "date_published": "2025-07-18T17:26:16.000Z",
            "content_html": "<h1 id=\"前言\"><a href=\"#前言\" class=\"headerlink\" title=\"前言\"></a>前言</h1><p>之前申请了腾讯云的免费CDN, 尝试用来加速git page, 但是发现速度并不理想, 还是考虑将阿里云的域名迁移到Cloudflare.</p>\n<h1 id=\"操作\"><a href=\"#操作\" class=\"headerlink\" title=\"操作\"></a>操作</h1><h2 id=\"1-在Cloudflare中添加域名\"><a href=\"#1-在Cloudflare中添加域名\" class=\"headerlink\" title=\"1. 在Cloudflare中添加域名\"></a>1. 在Cloudflare中添加域名</h2><p><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/xubiaolin/picgo/master/20250719020223544.png\"></p>\n<p>然后按照提示操作，这个时候会提示你修改DNS的地址</p>\n<h2 id=\"2-修改DNS地址\"><a href=\"#2-修改DNS地址\" class=\"headerlink\" title=\"2. 修改DNS地址\"></a>2. 修改DNS地址</h2><p><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/xubiaolin/picgo/master/20250719020434162.png\"></p>\n<h2 id=\"3-等待Cloudflare生效\"><a href=\"#3-等待Cloudflare生效\" class=\"headerlink\" title=\"3. 等待Cloudflare生效\"></a>3. 等待Cloudflare生效</h2><p><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/xubiaolin/picgo/master/20250719020554906.png\"></p>\n<h1 id=\"原理解析\"><a href=\"#原理解析\" class=\"headerlink\" title=\"原理解析\"></a>原理解析</h1><p>在域名解析（DNS）体系中，DNS服务器负责告诉全世界“你的域名对应哪个IP地址”。当你将域名的DNS服务器（NS记录）修改为Cloudflare提供的DNS地址后，全球的DNS查询都会先到Cloudflare的DNS服务器获取解析结果。</p>\n<p>Cloudflare的DNS服务器会返回Cloudflare代理的IP地址（而不是你源站的真实IP），这样所有访问你域名的流量都会先经过Cloudflare的边缘节点，由Cloudflare进行加速、防护和缓存等处理后，再转发到你的源站服务器。这就是“走Cloudflare代理”的原理。</p>\n<p>简要流程如下：</p>\n<ol>\n<li>你在域名注册商处将NS记录改为Cloudflare提供的DNS服务器。</li>\n<li>访问者在访问你的域名时，DNS查询会到Cloudflare的DNS服务器获取IP。</li>\n<li>Cloudflare返回代理IP，访问者的请求先到Cloudflare节点。</li>\n<li>Cloudflare根据你的设置决定是否回源、缓存、拦截等。</li>\n</ol>\n<p>因此，只要把DNS服务器切换到Cloudflare，Cloudflare就能“接管”你的域名流量，实现全站加速和安全防护。</p>\n<p><svg aria-roledescription=\"flowchart-v2\" role=\"graphics-document document\" viewBox=\"-8 -8 334.3359375 861.0546875\" style=\"max-width: 334.3359375px;\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"100%\" id=\"mermaid-svg-1752862055006-hj717j5np\"><style>#mermaid-svg-1752862055006-hj717j5np{font-family:”trebuchet ms”,verdana,arial,sans-serif;font-size:16px;fill:#cccccc;}#mermaid-svg-1752862055006-hj717j5np .error-icon{fill:#5a1d1d;}#mermaid-svg-1752862055006-hj717j5np .error-text{fill:#f85149;stroke:#f85149;}#mermaid-svg-1752862055006-hj717j5np .edge-thickness-normal{stroke-width:2px;}#mermaid-svg-1752862055006-hj717j5np .edge-thickness-thick{stroke-width:3.5px;}#mermaid-svg-1752862055006-hj717j5np .edge-pattern-solid{stroke-dasharray:0;}#mermaid-svg-1752862055006-hj717j5np .edge-pattern-dashed{stroke-dasharray:3;}#mermaid-svg-1752862055006-hj717j5np .edge-pattern-dotted{stroke-dasharray:2;}#mermaid-svg-1752862055006-hj717j5np .marker{fill:#cccccc;stroke:#cccccc;}#mermaid-svg-1752862055006-hj717j5np .marker.cross{stroke:#cccccc;}#mermaid-svg-1752862055006-hj717j5np svg{font-family:”trebuchet ms”,verdana,arial,sans-serif;font-size:16px;}#mermaid-svg-1752862055006-hj717j5np .label{font-family:”trebuchet ms”,verdana,arial,sans-serif;color:#cccccc;}#mermaid-svg-1752862055006-hj717j5np .cluster-label text{fill:#cccccc;}#mermaid-svg-1752862055006-hj717j5np .cluster-label span,#mermaid-svg-1752862055006-hj717j5np p{color:#cccccc;}#mermaid-svg-1752862055006-hj717j5np .label text,#mermaid-svg-1752862055006-hj717j5np span,#mermaid-svg-1752862055006-hj717j5np p{fill:#cccccc;color:#cccccc;}#mermaid-svg-1752862055006-hj717j5np .node rect,#mermaid-svg-1752862055006-hj717j5np .node circle,#mermaid-svg-1752862055006-hj717j5np .node ellipse,#mermaid-svg-1752862055006-hj717j5np .node polygon,#mermaid-svg-1752862055006-hj717j5np .node path{fill:#1f1f1f;stroke:#3c3c3c;stroke-width:1px;}#mermaid-svg-1752862055006-hj717j5np .flowchart-label text{text-anchor:middle;}#mermaid-svg-1752862055006-hj717j5np .node .label{text-align:center;}#mermaid-svg-1752862055006-hj717j5np .node.clickable{cursor:pointer;}#mermaid-svg-1752862055006-hj717j5np .arrowheadPath{fill:#e0e0e0;}#mermaid-svg-1752862055006-hj717j5np .edgePath .path{stroke:#cccccc;stroke-width:2.0px;}#mermaid-svg-1752862055006-hj717j5np .flowchart-link{stroke:#cccccc;fill:none;}#mermaid-svg-1752862